name: Crossfire
pool: Hard
description: Grapplers deal no damage; the damage is whatever you were standing in front of. Your own line is a collision waiting to happen — so put one of theirs in the lane instead.
retired: superseded by cb-09-crossfire-v2, which carries the same thesis over connected blocking mass and a question still live on round 3 (D-280). Kept parseable: the replay logs of every run that played it still name this id.
design: Combat Manoeuvre 9 — the pull lane.
design: No pits, no spikes. Two Grapplers on opposite edges and two tiles of high ground they both want.

spawn g = Grappler
spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
